OL,3,ACyprus police open investigation into
OL,4,Afinancial affairs of Roman Abramovich
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Cyprus have opened an
OL,7,Finvestigation into the financial
OL,8,Faffairs of Roman Abramovich, following
OL,9,Frevelations by BBC Panorama that
OL,10,Faccountancy firm Deloitte helped in
OL,11,Ffalsifying documents to hide his wealth
OL,12,Fand evade tax.
OL,14,FSerious questions about the integrity
OL,15,Fof some of Abramovich's professional
OL,16,Fadvisers were raised earlier this month
OL,17,Fin a joint report from the BBC and the
OL,18,FBureau of Investigative Journalism
OL,19,F(TBIJ).
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
