OL,3,ACyprus police open investigation into
OL,4,Afinancial affairs of Roman Abramovich
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Cypriot Ministry of Justice official
OL,7,Ftold MPs this week that the report's
OL,8,Ffindings would be looked at as part of
OL,9,Fa new investigation by the police's
OL,10,FFinancial Intelligence Unit.
OL,12,FLawyers for Abramovich have said that
OL,13,Fhe denies evading tax or concealing his
OL,14,Ffortune. Deloitte Cyprus said it acts
OL,15,F"in compliance with applicable laws".
